      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would much prefer that `OnPlayerRestored` would always get called regardless of if there was data to restore. Bonus if we get a status parameter on `VRCPlayerApi` indicating `Success`, `Failed`, and `NoDataToRestore`.",
