      "value": "@{62df3a55f6fa434679f836fa|full_name}\n\nApparently on the PlayerData docs `OnPlayerRestored` is supposed to be called regardless if there is any data to restore (I have not tested recently so this could be the case now):\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/persistence/player-data#:~:text=This%20event%20will%20run%20even%20if%20you%20have%20no%20save%20data",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
